msgid "Наследование моделей"
msgstr "Model inheritance"

msgid ""
"Чтобы несколько сообщений использовали одинаковое framing, вынесите настройки в базовый класс, а "
"поля объявите в конкретных моделях:"
msgstr ""
"To give several messages the same framing, put the settings in a base class and declare fields in"
" the concrete models:"

msgid ""
"from bytespec import Constructor, Flags, PayloadLength, ProtoModel, SchemaError\n"
"from bytespec.types import UInt8\n"
"\n"
"class Compact(ProtoModel):\n"
"    __header__ = (Constructor(1), PayloadLength(1))\n"
"\n"
"class Reading(Compact):\n"
"    __constructor__ = 7\n"
"    value: UInt8\n"
"\n"
"reading = Reading(value=42)\n"
"assert Reading.decode(reading.encode()) == reading\n"
"print(reading.encode().hex(\" \"))"
msgstr ""
"from bytespec import Constructor, Flags, PayloadLength, ProtoModel, SchemaError\n"
"from bytespec.types import UInt8\n"
"\n"
"class Compact(ProtoModel):\n"
"    __header__ = (Constructor(1), PayloadLength(1))\n"
"\n"
"class Reading(Compact):\n"
"    __constructor__ = 7\n"
"    value: UInt8\n"
"\n"
"reading = Reading(value=42)\n"
"assert Reading.decode(reading.encode()) == reading\n"
"print(reading.encode().hex(\" \"))"

msgid "07 01 2a"
msgstr "07 01 2a"

msgid ""
"Наследуются ``__header__``, ``__constructor__``, ``__byte_order__`` и правила "
"``configure_codecs()``. Framing-настройки можно переопределить и в подклассе без собственных "
"полей: каждый подкласс получает заново собранную схему."
msgstr ""
"``__header__``, ``__constructor__``, ``__byte_order__``, and ``configure_codecs()`` rules are "
"inherited. Framing settings can also be overridden in a subclass with no fields of its own: each "
"subclass gets a newly built schema."

msgid "Несколько базовых классов"
msgstr "Multiple base classes"

msgid ""
"При отсутствии явного ``__header__`` учитываются custom headers прямых баз ``ProtoModel``. "
"Стандартный header не конкурирует с пользовательским:"
msgstr ""
"Without an explicit ``__header__``, custom headers from direct ``ProtoModel`` bases are "
"considered. The default header does not compete with a custom one:"

msgid ""
"class DefaultBase(ProtoModel):\n"
"    pass\n"
"\n"
"class Mixed(DefaultBase, Compact):\n"
"    value: UInt8\n"
"\n"
"assert Mixed.__header__ is Compact.__header__\n"
"assert Mixed.decode(Mixed(value=1).encode()) == Mixed(value=1)"
msgstr ""
"class DefaultBase(ProtoModel):\n"
"    pass\n"
"\n"
"class Mixed(DefaultBase, Compact):\n"
"    value: UInt8\n"
"\n"
"assert Mixed.__header__ is Compact.__header__\n"
"assert Mixed.decode(Mixed(value=1).encode()) == Mixed(value=1)"

msgid "Diamond inheritance одного header тоже допустим:"
msgstr "Diamond inheritance of the same header is also allowed:"

msgid ""
"class Left(Compact):\n"
"    pass\n"
"\n"
"class Right(Compact):\n"
"    pass\n"
"\n"
"class Diamond(Left, Right):\n"
"    value: UInt8\n"
"\n"
"assert Diamond.__header__ is Compact.__header__\n"
"assert Diamond.decode(Diamond(value=2).encode()) == Diamond(value=2)"
msgstr ""
"class Left(Compact):\n"
"    pass\n"
"\n"
"class Right(Compact):\n"
"    pass\n"
"\n"
"class Diamond(Left, Right):\n"
"    value: UInt8\n"
"\n"
"assert Diamond.__header__ is Compact.__header__\n"
"assert Diamond.decode(Diamond(value=2).encode()) == Diamond(value=2)"

msgid "Два разных custom headers требуют явного выбора:"
msgstr "Two different custom headers require an explicit choice:"

msgid ""
"class Other(ProtoModel):\n"
"    __header__ = (PayloadLength(2),)\n"
"\n"
"try:\n"
"    class Conflict(Compact, Other):\n"
"        value: UInt8\n"
"except SchemaError as error:\n"
"    print(error)\n"
"\n"
"class Resolved(Compact, Other):\n"
"    __header__ = Compact.__header__\n"
"    value: UInt8\n"
"\n"
"assert Resolved.decode(Resolved(value=3).encode()) == Resolved(value=3)"
msgstr ""
"class Other(ProtoModel):\n"
"    __header__ = (PayloadLength(2),)\n"
"\n"
"try:\n"
"    class Conflict(Compact, Other):\n"
"        value: UInt8\n"
"except SchemaError as error:\n"
"    print(error)\n"
"\n"
"class Resolved(Compact, Other):\n"
"    __header__ = Compact.__header__\n"
"    value: UInt8\n"
"\n"
"assert Resolved.decode(Resolved(value=3).encode()) == Resolved(value=3)"

msgid "Conflict: conflicting inherited headers; define __header__ explicitly"
msgstr "Conflict: conflicting inherited headers; define __header__ explicitly"

msgid ""
"Сравнивается **идентичность tuple**, а не эквивалентность элементов. Два независимо созданных "
"``(Constructor(1), PayloadLength(1))`` конфликтуют даже при одинаковом wire format. Чтобы "
"переиспользовать один header, наследуйте его или присвойте существующий tuple. Пустой tuple "
"``()`` тоже считается custom header. Специальное объединение применяется только к header; "
"остальные настройки следуют обычному порядку поиска Python."
msgstr ""
"The comparison uses **tuple identity**, not element equivalence. Two independently created "
"``(Constructor(1), PayloadLength(1))`` tuples conflict even if their wire format is identical. To"
" reuse a header, inherit it or assign an existing tuple. The empty tuple ``()`` also counts as a "
"custom header. This special resolution applies only to the header; other settings follow Python's"
" normal lookup order."

msgid "Поля не объединяются"
msgstr "Fields are not merged"

msgid "Подкласс с собственными полями строит схему **только из них**:"
msgstr "A subclass that declares its own fields builds a schema **only from those fields**:"

msgid ""
"class Parent(ProtoModel):\n"
"    __header__ = ()\n"
"    first: UInt8\n"
"\n"
"class Child(Parent):\n"
"    second: UInt8\n"
"\n"
"child = Child(second=2)\n"
"print(child.encode().hex(\" \"))"
msgstr ""
"class Parent(ProtoModel):\n"
"    __header__ = ()\n"
"    first: UInt8\n"
"\n"
"class Child(Parent):\n"
"    second: UInt8\n"
"\n"
"child = Child(second=2)\n"
"print(child.encode().hex(\" \"))"

msgid "02"
msgstr "02"

msgid ""
"``first`` в схему ``Child`` не попадает. Для структуры «родительские данные плюс новые данные» "
"используйте :doc:`collections` или явно объявите весь набор полей дочерней модели."
msgstr ""
"``first`` is not included in the ``Child`` schema. For a structure containing parent data plus "
"new data, use :doc:`collections` or explicitly declare the complete set of fields in the child "
"model."

msgid "Изменить framing, сохранив поля"
msgstr "Change framing while preserving fields"

msgid ""
"Подкласс без собственных сериализуемых полей сохраняет унаследованные поля, их codecs, defaults и"
" factories. Для него создаётся отдельная схема с его ``__constructor__``, ``__header__`` и "
"``__byte_order__``. Повторять поля ради смены framing не нужно:"
msgstr ""
"A subclass with no serializable fields of its own retains the inherited fields, their codecs, "
"defaults, and factories. It gets a separate schema with its own ``__constructor__``, "
"``__header__``, and ``__byte_order__``. You do not need to repeat fields just to change framing:"

msgid ""
"from bytespec import ByteOrder\n"
"from bytespec.types import UInt16\n"
"\n"
"class ReadingBase(ProtoModel):\n"
"    __constructor__ = 2\n"
"    __header__ = (Constructor(1), PayloadLength(1))\n"
"    value: UInt16\n"
"\n"
"class LittleReading(ReadingBase):\n"
"    __constructor__ = 3\n"
"    __header__ = (PayloadLength(1), Constructor(2))\n"
"    __byte_order__ = ByteOrder.LITTLE\n"
"\n"
"reading = LittleReading(value=0x1234)\n"
"assert LittleReading.decode(reading.encode()) == reading\n"
"print(reading.encode().hex(\" \"))\n"
"print(ReadingBase(value=0x1234).encode().hex(\" \"))"
msgstr ""
"from bytespec import ByteOrder\n"
"from bytespec.types import UInt16\n"
"\n"
"class ReadingBase(ProtoModel):\n"
"    __constructor__ = 2\n"
"    __header__ = (Constructor(1), PayloadLength(1))\n"
"    value: UInt16\n"
"\n"
"class LittleReading(ReadingBase):\n"
"    __constructor__ = 3\n"
"    __header__ = (PayloadLength(1), Constructor(2))\n"
"    __byte_order__ = ByteOrder.LITTLE\n"
"\n"
"reading = LittleReading(value=0x1234)\n"
"assert LittleReading.decode(reading.encode()) == reading\n"
"print(reading.encode().hex(\" \"))\n"
"print(ReadingBase(value=0x1234).encode().hex(\" \"))"

msgid ""
"02 03 00 34 12\n"
"02 02 12 34"
msgstr ""
"02 03 00 34 12\n"
"02 02 12 34"

msgid ""
"В первой строке длина идёт перед двухбайтовым constructor, а число записано little-endian. Формат"
" родителя не изменился. Если в унаследованных полях есть optional, новый header тоже должен "
"содержать ``Flags`` достаточной ширины: иначе объявление подкласса завершается ``SchemaError``."
msgstr ""
"In the first line, the length comes before the two-byte constructor, and the number is written in"
" little-endian order. The parent's format is unchanged. If the inherited fields include optional "
"fields, the new header must also contain ``Flags`` wide enough to accommodate them; otherwise, "
"declaring the subclass raises ``SchemaError``."

msgid ""
"При multiple inheritance без собственных полей используется первый доступный набор полей по MRO, "
"без объединения схем базовых классов. Правило выбора custom header при этом остаётся описанным "
"выше."
msgstr ""
"With multiple inheritance and no fields of its own, a subclass uses the first available set of "
"fields in the MRO, without merging base-class schemas. The custom header selection rule described"
" above still applies."

msgid ""
"Автоматический вызов ``__validate__`` имеет отдельное правило: метод родителя сам не вызывается "
"для дочернего экземпляра. Как явно переиспользовать проверку — :doc:`validation`."
msgstr ""
"Automatic ``__validate__`` calls follow a separate rule: the parent's method is not automatically"
" called for a child instance. See :doc:`validation` for how to reuse validation explicitly."

